```javascript
Lights:
- Ambient: Low cyan (#00FFFF, 0.2 intensity)
- Directional: Magenta top-down (#FF00FF)
- Point Lights: Multiple neon sources
- Spotlights: Building windows
- Rim Light: White edge definition

Dynamic:
- Lights flicker subtly
- Neon signs pulse
