## 14. Accessibility in 3D

### Reduced Motion Mode

```javascript
Accessibility Settings:
├── Reduce Motion
│   ├── Disable parallax
│   ├── Simplified transitions
│   ├── No auto-rotation
│   └── Static backgrounds
├── Reduce Effects
│   ├── No particles
│   ├── Minimal post-processing
│   ├── No glitch effects
│   └── Solid colors
└── High Contrast Mode
    ├── Stronger outlines
    ├── Simplified shaders
    └── Clear focus indicators
```

### Focus Management
- Visible focus rings (3D glow)
- Keyboard navigation through 3D space
- Screen reader descriptions of 3D scenes
- Alternative 2D mode available

