## 16. Technical Performance Benchmarks

### Desktop Targets
```
60 FPS (16.67ms per frame):
- Draw calls: < 100
- Triangles: < 500,000
- Shader complexity: Medium-High
- Particles: 1000-2000
- Post-processing: All effects
- Texture memory: < 500MB
```

### Mobile Targets
```
30 FPS (33.33ms per frame):
- Draw calls: < 50
- Triangles: < 100,000
- Shader complexity: Low-Medium
- Particles: 200-500
- Post-processing: Bloom only
- Texture memory: < 150MB
```

### Optimization Techniques
- Object pooling for particles
- Frustum culling
- LOD (Level of Detail) systems
- Texture atlasing
- Instanced mesh rendering
- Deferred shader loading
- Web Workers for heavy calculations

