## 17. Developer Handoff Checklist

### Asset Requirements
- [ ] All 3D models in GLTF/GLB format
- [ ] Textures: Power-of-2 dimensions, compressed
- [ ] Shaders: Documented and modular
- [ ] Audio: Compressed, web-optimized
- [ ] Fonts: WOFF2 format + SDF textures

